# Corpses of the Lost: "At the beginning of your end step, if you descended this turn, you may pay 1 life. If you do, return
# this enchantment to its owner's hand." Turn 1 Bot1 casts it (Mox Jet, Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl), then Faithless Looting (a
# Mountain) draws two Plains and discards an Ornithopter and a Plains: permanent cards put into Bot1's graveyard, so Bot1
# descended (CR 700.11). At the end step Bot1 pays 1 life (19) and the enchantment returns to hand. The Skeleton Pirate
# token stays, but with Corpses of the Lost gone it is a plain 2/2 with no haste.

